  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Across Tokyo, quiet university student Megumi dines at an upscale Italian restaurant with her protective mother Kayo. When Megumi gently shares her dream of studying painting at an Italian art school someday, Kayo panics and begs her daughter never to leave her side. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "トマトベースがすごくおいしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あとでデザートも頼みましょうね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "デザートじゃなくてドルチェですよ。イタリアではそう呼ぶの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あら、やっぱり詳しいのね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "お母さん、私ね、いつかイタリアに留学したいの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "本格的に絵のお勉強したくって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "お願い。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "どうしたの？大丈夫？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "近くにいてほしいの、いつも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あなたを愛してるの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "分かってます。ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "トマトベースがすごくおいしい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This tomato-based sauce is really delicious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あとでデザートも頼みましょうね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's order dessert afterwards too, shall we?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "デザートじゃなくてドルチェですよ。イタリアではそう呼ぶの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's called dolce, not dessert. That's what they call it in Italy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あら、やっぱり詳しいのね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh my, you really do know all about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "お母さん、私ね、いつかイタリアに留学したいの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mother, listen—someday I want to study abroad in Italy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "本格的に絵のお勉強したくって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really want to study painting seriously.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "お願い。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "どうしたの？大丈夫？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's wrong? Are you alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "近くにいてほしいの、いつも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want you to stay close to me, always.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "あなたを愛してるの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I love you so much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "分かってます。ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know. I'm sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.65
